{"baseRefName":"main","baseRefOid":"6695d6a387b0ce362aa9411e63b36e4a0db066b2","body":"This adopts the finite Core/2 observation contract and adds complete escrow checks through the real library and CLI. The tests compare the full Program and filled Plan, three complete library reports, and three CLI reports with exact ASCII stdout, empty stderr and actual continuation chaining from funding through a false observation to delivery. All 43 oracle payloads were independently frozen before test authoring; declared source exposure and the original partial freeze remain preserved.\n\nValidation: the offline, single-job `cargo test -p mori --no-default-features --test core2_escrow_complete -- --test-threads=1` check passed all three tests in 54.70 seconds on tree `1e3fc1912705ce349353accaee7924644e684012`. Fresh source and actual-result audits approve their exact scopes; the separate ordinary and designated-owner reviews cover the four documentation/receipt paths. The initial source audit timeout is retained. Attempted work is 5/2/6, committed work is 5/5/11, and the false observation preserves its continuation. No production code or dependencies change. Authentication, tracked consumption, all 14 staged gaps and original compiler/proof/ledger exits remain open.\n","files":[{"path":"crates/fixtures/core2-escrow-complete/CASES.json","additions":44,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"crates/fixtures/core2-escrow-complete/DERIVATION.md","additions":67,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"crates/fixtures/core2-escrow-complete/FIELD-PREMISES.json","additions":91,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"crates/fixtures/core2-escrow-complete/FINANCIAL-AND-WORK.json","additions":1234,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"crates/fixtures/core2-escrow-complete/FREEZE.sha256","additions":43,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"crates/fixtures/core2-escrow-complete/INVENTORY.json","additions":506,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"crates/fi